            "heading_size": 7,
            "text": "<p>June has been packed with <strong>creativity, colour, and connection</strong> here at Simran Design Ltd. </p><p></p><p>From industry-leading exhibitions to restaurant launches and meeting the infamous <strong>Kelly Hoppen</strong>, here’s a look inside what we’ve been up to...</p>",
