    "section_rich_text_7XbMG6": {
      "type": "section-rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_iFjgpq": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>3. '<strong>Maza at Eighty Six' - announding our first restaurant in cambridge</strong></h4><p></p>",
            "text_size": 4,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 20
          }
        },
        "text_TbRMpQ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>This June, we revealed the launch of <strong>Maza at Eighty Six</strong> - a new flagship restaurant in the heart of Cambridge, fully designed and branded by Simran Design Ltd.</p><p>Located on a prime corner of Mill Road, <strong>Maza</strong> is an authentic Pakistani-Indian restaurant brought to life from concept to completion - starting with a bare shell and ending in a one-of-a-kind hospitality destination.</p><p>We were given full creative control: from <strong>naming the restaurant </strong>and crafting the <strong>visual identity</strong> (logo, typeface, packaging and signage) to designing the space itself. The upstairs dining area features rich <strong>jewel tones</strong>, swing seats at the window (a Cambridge first), a custom bar tiled in multicoloured ceramic, and back-to-back banquette booths finished in natural materials like jute and rattan.</p><p>This is one of the most expressive, layered hospitality projects we’ve worked on - and we can’t wait to reveal more as the final touches go in ahead of the <strong>September 2025 launch</strong>.</p>",
            "text_size": 3,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        },
        "buttons_WkrR3H": {
          "type": "buttons",
          "settings": {
            "button_text": "Maza 3D Visualisations",
            "button_url": "shopify://pages/maza-restaurant",
            "button_type": "btn--secondary",
            "button_size": "",
            "button_style": "btn--solid",
            "show_arrow": true,
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_iFjgpq",
        "text_TbRMpQ",
        "buttons_WkrR3H"
      ],
      "name": "Rich text",
      "settings": {
        "width": "wrapper",
        "align_text": "text-left",
