    "section_columns_FUVbtk": {
      "type": "section-columns",
      "blocks": {
        "image_ExBbjH": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/20250604_102251.heic",
            "image_aspect_ratio": 1,
            "mobile_image_aspect_ratio": 1,
            "image_shape": "normal",
            "title": "Maza at Eighty Six, Cambridge:",
            "heading_size": 3,
            "text": "<p>We specified <strong>Lenton vertical indoor-outdoor tiles</strong> for their striking glaze and natural variation for inside and outside the restaurant due to their frost resistance and to protect against many a Cambridge bicycle. We finalised the layout for our multi-coloured bar front as per our 3D renders.</p>",
            "text_size": 3,
            "button_text": "",
            "button_url": "shopify://pages/copy-of-workspace-lounge",
            "button_type": "btn--white",
            "button_size": "",
            "button_style": "btn--solid",
            "show_arrow": true
          }
        },
        "image_q4z6pG": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_3579.heic",
            "image_aspect_ratio": 1,
            "mobile_image_aspect_ratio": 1,
            "image_shape": "normal",
            "title": "Herdays Café, Kirkby-in-Ashfield:",
            "heading_size": 3,
            "text": "<p>Inspired by acai bowls and matcha lattes, we embraced a <em>soft pink and green palette</em> when sourcing the perfect tiles to form a playful backsplash and elegant bathroom accent on the walls and floor. Soft launching in July 2025, @herdays_uk is one to watch.</p><p></p><p></p>",
            "text_size": 3,
            "button_text": "",
            "button_url": "shopify://pages/dubai-recruitment-office",
            "button_type": "btn--white",
            "button_size": "",
            "button_style": "btn--solid",
            "show_arrow": true
          }
        },
        "image_89ybm8": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_6642.png",
            "image_aspect_ratio": 1,
            "mobile_image_aspect_ratio": 1,
            "image_shape": "normal",
            "title": "Amid Palace Restaurant, Nuneaton:",
            "heading_size": 3,
            "text": "<p>A bold black, red, gold, and white palette with statement <em>geometric large-format tiles</em>, used to create visual zoning across this 120-seater restaurant. These tiles will be strategically placed under key seating zones, in the VIP room and Reception.</p>",
            "text_size": 3,
